model:model_default a fram:FRAMModel ;
    schema:name "EAC2-Patriarca et al. (2024) - FRW Healthcare Renal Surgery" ;
    rdfs:comment "FRAM model of renal surgery (14 functions, 21 couplings). Working model contains S0 nominal metadata. Two scenarios: S0 (nominal) and S1 (hemorrhagic event, F04 DC4). Methodology: Functional Random Walker (FRW) with DC1-DC5. DC2(iii): combination-based output activation with per-output activate expressions. Eq.19: multiplicative precision propagation over all upstream couplings." ;
