    rdfs:comment "Output (O) is that which is the result of the function, either \nas an entity or as a state change. The Output is typically what the function is \nsupposed to produce or achieve, and it serves as Input, Precondition, Resource, \nControl, or Time for downstream functions.\nExamples: A product, a decision, information, a state change, a treated patient." ;
