    fram:semanticRole "Temporal aspects affecting the function's execution" ;
    rdfs:comment "Time (T) represents the various temporal aspects that affect \nhow a function is carried out. This can include duration constraints, deadlines, \nsynchronization requirements, or temporal dependencies.\nExamples: Deadlines, time windows, synchronization with other functions, \nsequence requirements, duration limits." .

